# Security

- 50X candidates are security-scanned before scoring for recommendation. Scan failure → UNKNOWN → excluded from recommendation pool.
- Check mint/burn/blacklist/whitelist/freeze/pause/tax/maxTx/maxWallet/trading restriction/honeypot/anti-sell/owner/proxy/LP lock/verification/hidden mint.
- Wallet risk: top holders, team, insider, whale clusters, known scam addresses when the source provides them.
- Verdicts: SAFE, LOW_RISK, MEDIUM_RISK, HIGH_RISK, MALICIOUS, UNKNOWN, NATIVE_PROTOCOL.
- No private keys or mnemonics in DB. Public address only. Future signing must use an external wallet.
- No live order routing. Analysis / simulation / tracking / alert only.
- Secrets from env. Redact secrets in logs.
